  hinge_area_right  [right]  stage 'execute_path'  2002 waypoints
     targets |  movej max    mean |  movel max    mean   (mm)
          10 |       92.6    18.5   |       92.6    17.4 
          20 |       57.6    11.7   |       58.0    11.5 
          40 |       22.1     4.9   |       22.1     2.6 
